Inserting `8 3 10 1 6 14`:

```text
        8
      /   \
     3     10
    / \      \
   1   6      14
```

Searching for 6: 6 < 8 → left to 3; 6 > 3 → right to 6 — found at depth 2. Searching for 7 follows the same path, then 7 > 6 → right of 6 is empty: not found.

