Range sum over [7, 15] in the tree built from `10 5 15 3 7 18`:

| node | in range? | go to |
|---|---|---|
| 10 | yes (+10) | both |
| 5 | below 7 | right only (skip 3) |
| 7 | yes (+7) | both (empty) |
| 15 | yes (+15) | both |
| 18 | above 15 | left only (empty) |

Total 32. Node 3 is never visited.

